#: ../smart-base/processes/content/classify-and-code-content.bpmn:45
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A person acting in the l1-extraction-reviewer role (owner ruling 3b, 2026-10-12). Opens the printed page (sections/page-NNN.md) beside exclusions.proposed.json, reads each sentence proposed for exclusion in its surrounding context, verifies that the stated reason (background-fact, manufacturer-statement, editorial, research-question, duplicate-of) holds, and signs the exclusion (signedOffBy) or rejects it back to the authoring agent so no normative guidance is silently dropped."
msgstr ""

#: ../smart-base/processes/content/classify-and-code-content.bpmn:50
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A person acting in the terminologist role, equipped with ontologist, glossary-terms, terminology-management, and classify-and-code-content. Reviews the staged slot classifications and codings against the terminology-coding methodology: checks that the right scheme and reuse-first rung were selected, verifies skos:exactMatch vs skos:closeMatch precision, adjudicates Rung 4 local glossary candidates (promoting valid terms from candidate to authored or replacing them with a standard code), and records the review verdict."
msgstr ""

#: ../smart-base/processes/content/classify-and-code-content.bpmn:132
#. Diagram label
msgid "Adjudicate slot codings and glossary candidates"
msgstr ""

#: ../smart-base/processes/content/classify-and-code-content.bpmn:157
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "All L1 coverage exclusions are signed by l1-extraction-reviewer, slot codings are marked reviewed, and approved local glossary terms are promoted to authored."
msgstr ""

